#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:7
#: e64406a3d0f14a35b5690d9efd419ce8
msgid ""
"This page describes how to protect an ArduPilot vehicle from external "
"threats."
msgstr "本页介绍如何保护 ArduPilot 飞行器免受外部威胁。"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:17
#: 6c0f75002cb445a686f06e0fb390a301
msgid ""
"The first step in protecting the vehicle is to ensure that it is physically "
"secure.  If a malicious individual has physical access to the vehicle there "
"are numerous ways they could endanger the system including cutting wires, "
"breaking propellers, adding devices that interfere with the sensors "
"(vibration, magnetic interference, EMI).  While the ArduPilot software has "
"`pre-arm checks <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-prearm-safety-"
"checks.html>`__ that may catch some methods of vandalism, it cannot protect "
"against them all."
msgstr ""
"保护飞行器的第一步是确保其物理安全。如果恶意人员能够物理接触飞行器，他们有多种方式危害系统，包括剪断线缆、破坏螺旋桨、添加干扰传感器的设备（震动、磁干扰、EMI）。虽然"
" ArduPilot 软件具有 `解锁前检查 <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-prearm-"
"safety-checks.html>`__，可以发现某些破坏手段，但无法防范所有情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:19
#: bbf2a7bdaf954eac80e7f985aef9c8ac
msgid ""
"While security is important, some security measures can affect usability so "
"a balanced approach keeping in mind the user's needs and rights under the "
":ref:`GPLv3 license <license-gplv3>` is also important."
msgstr ""
"虽然安全很重要，但某些安全措施可能影响可用性，因此兼顾用户在 :ref:`GPLv3 许可证 <license-gplv3>` "
"下的需求和权利、采取平衡的方式同样重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:22
#: e8f283b6355940949b23b11898114f3c
msgid "Security Attack Surface"
msgstr "安全攻击面"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:24
#: c1d151e38a34434f8c9fde3a6cfb8481
msgid ""
"The \"security attack surface\" is the set of access points that a malicious"
" actor could use to gain access to the autopilot and disrupt its operation."
"  Below is a table of these surfaces with advice on how they may be "
"protected.  These surfaces are all considered trusted by default."
msgstr "“安全攻击面”是指恶意行为者可用来访问飞控并干扰其运行的一组接入点。下表列出了这些攻击面以及相应的保护建议。这些攻击面默认均被视为可信。"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:30
#: 47c10b940b6245f2ae713cd62e97d7f9
msgid "Access Point"
msgstr "接入点"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:31
#: 3982ac3f708b40868d788d42bbc7d1ed
msgid "Recommendations"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:32
#: 81330712b1af4313b5436f05b1815741
