msgstr "`以太网 <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-network.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:35
#: d5e374ba1fa94a1d8f293b88413cbbd5
msgid ""
"Used primarily for :ref:`companion computers <companion-computers>` and "
"`camera gimbals <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-cameras-and-"
"gimbals.html>`__ and protection should be applied to their attack surfaces"
msgstr ""
"主要用于 :ref:`伴飞计算机 <companion-computers>` 和 `相机云台 "
