"gimbals.html>`__，应对它们的攻击面加以保护"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:36
#: 09333abf7c194ffdb64252981bc8dfa4
msgid "GPS"
msgstr "GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:37
#: 8ea7cfd8d7b24ae4856d61e989a64c88
msgid ""
"Susceptible to jamming and spoofing.  The `EKF failsafe "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.html>`__ may trigger a "
"failsafe action but consider adding `Non-GPS navigation "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-non-gps-navigation-landing-"
"page.html>`__ as a backup"
msgstr ""
"易受干扰和欺骗。`EKF 失控保护 <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/ekf-inav-"
"failsafe.html>`__ 可能会触发失控保护动作，但可考虑添加 `非 GPS 导航 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-non-gps-navigation-landing-"
"page.html>`__ 作为备份"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:38
#: 5c0d70569e9d49e2a5870f3f44a0e3c3
msgid "I2C / SPI"
msgstr "I2C / SPI"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:39
#: 10daf2dd530645cab8dd0536c7ae45a5
msgid ""
"Used for IMU and some `peripherals "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-optional-hardware.html>`__ "
"including compass and lidar"
msgstr ""
"用于 IMU 以及部分 `外围设备 <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-optional-"
"hardware.html>`__，包括罗盘和激光雷达"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:40
#: 5b78e340c5f9441da07433dd34d1efea
msgid "RC Receiver Input"
msgstr "遥控接收机输入"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:41
#: ccc1fb5e3b0c4e519cbd9c0cb62cd9a1
msgid ""
"Used for pilot control of the vehicle in manual `flight modes "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/flight-modes.html>`__, `flight mode "
"selection <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-"
"mode-configuration.html>`__ and `auxiliary switch functions "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-auxiliary-functions.html>`__.  "
"Check the attack surface of the pilot's transmitter and the RC receiver on "
"the vehicle.  Use the ``RC_PROTOCOLS`` parameter to enable only the "
"protocols being used."
msgstr ""
"用于在手动 `飞行模式 <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/flight-modes.html>`__ "
"下由飞手控制飞行器、`飞行模式选择 <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-rc-transmitter-"
"flight-mode-configuration.html>`__ 以及 `辅助开关功能 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-auxiliary-"
"functions.html>`__。请检查飞手遥控器和飞行器上接收机的攻击面。使用 ``RC_PROTOCOLS`` 参数仅启用实际使用的协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:42
#: dd2bcd74070e47728003e8614d5a35eb
msgid "SD Card"
msgstr "SD 卡"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:43
#: d5a89335c3e8401e90679df5f7653e9d
msgid ""
"Accessed physically or via :ref:`MAVFtp <mavlink-mavftp>`.  Used for `log "
"files <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-logs.html>`__, `rally points"
" <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-rally-points.html>`__, `terrain "
"data storage <https://ardupilot.org/plane/docs/common-terrain-"
"following.html>`__, `Lua scripts <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-"
"lua-scripts.html>`__ and (optionally) `firmware installation "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-install-sdcard.html>`__.  "
"Physically secure the SD card, enable :ref:`MAVLink2 Signing <common-"
"MAVLink2-signing>` and check the attack surfaces of the telemetry "
"connections.  Include :ref:`Lua scripts directly in the firmware <common-"
"oem-customizations>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:44
#: ef175fec1579441eabfcaece7457625e
msgid "Serial Ports"
msgstr "串口"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:45
#: 8e34c2db30df4fe0b87a0b2cae3c01ea
msgid ""
"Used for MAVLink and `peripherals <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-"
"optional-hardware.html>`__.  Check the attack surface of the peripheral "
"and/or enable :ref:`MAVLink2 Signing <common-MAVLink2-signing>`.  See "
"\"Ground Control Stations\" section below"
msgstr ""
"用于 MAVLink 和 `外围设备 <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-optional-"
"hardware.html>`__。请检查外围设备的攻击面和/或启用 :ref:`MAVLink2 签名 <common-"
"MAVLink2-signing>`。参见下文“地面控制站”部分"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:46
#: 5194f3a994bc4313ac5a6a6c736ca5bd
msgid "USB port"
msgstr "USB 接口"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:47
#: 219c0c891656404bb7d3ed6baf5be082
msgid ""
"Used for both firmware uploads and MAVLink communication.  See :ref:`Secure "
"Firmware <secure-firmware>` for instructions on installing a tamper-proof "
"bootloader.  :ref:`MAVLink2 Signing <common-MAVLink2-signing>` is not "
"supported but setting SERIAL0_PROTOCOL = 0 disables MAVLink on this port"
msgstr ""
"既用于固件上传，也用于 MAVLink 通信。有关安装防篡改 bootloader 的说明，参见 :ref:`安全固件 <secure-"
"firmware>`。此端口不支持 :ref:`MAVLink2 签名 <common-MAVLink2-signing>`，但将 "
"SERIAL0_PROTOCOL 设为 0 可禁用该端口上的 MAVLink"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:49
#: 73b33a78d1c34fa097e0e1f708e69617
msgid ""
"Please note that ArduPilot is very often operating in a resource-constrained"
" environment meaning it cannot, on its own, provide all the checks required "
"to ensure a bulletproof system.  Instead the system as a whole must be "
"designed to be secure.  To this end, by default, the inputs to the autopilot"
" (aka \"attack surfaces\") are trusted.  We trust our SPI-connected inertial"
" sensors to be well-behaved, for example."
msgstr ""
"请注意，ArduPilot "
"通常运行在资源受限的环境中，这意味着它无法单靠自身提供确保系统万无一失所需的全部检查。相反，必须将整个系统设计为安全的。为此，默认情况下，飞控的输入（即“攻击面”）是被信任的。例如，我们信任通过"
" SPI 连接的惯性传感器行为正常。"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:52
#: ea5955f67c95496abf89cff0c8b3a4cc
msgid "Ground Control Stations"
msgstr "地面控制站"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:54
#: 07e5fc10258d4fb4b1526d1307745cd7
msgid ""
"Most notable amongst \"trusted\" data sources are connections to the Ground "
"Control Station.  We expect GCSs to be well-behaved in terms of the data "
"sent to the autopilot.  Remember that your GCS can disarm your vehicle mid-"
"air or force it into terrain as a matter of course."
msgstr ""
"在“受信任”的数据源中，最值得注意的是与地面控制站的连接。我们期望 GCS 在发送给飞控的数据方面行为正常。请记住，您的 GCS "
"本来就可以在空中给飞行器上锁，或强制其撞向地面。"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:56
#: d42fa4ea6de34a28a07c0dffacb5b771
msgid ""
"We disable floating point exceptions in the embedded firmware, meaning that "
"a lot of floating point operations which would result in a Floating Point "
"Exception now simply don't.  By default we do NOT disable floating point "
"exceptions in SITL, allowing errors in Ground Control Stations to be picked "
"up in SITL rather than when someone is flying a real vehicle.  To more-"
"closely approximate what happens on our embedded platforms, you can use the "
"``SIM_FLOAT_EXCEPT`` parameter to disable floating point exceptions in "
"ArduPilot SITL.  This may help find real problems when trying to use fuzzers"
" to find problems with the ArduPilot codebase."
msgstr ""
"我们在嵌入式固件中禁用了浮点异常，这意味着许多本会导致浮点异常（Floating Point "
"Exception）的浮点运算现在不会再触发异常。默认情况下，我们不会在 SITL 中禁用浮点异常，以便地面控制站中的错误能在 SITL "
"中被发现，而不是等到有人驾驶真实飞行器时才暴露。为了更接近地模拟嵌入式平台上的行为，您可以使用 ``SIM_FLOAT_EXCEPT`` 参数在 "
"ArduPilot SITL 中禁用浮点异常。在尝试使用模糊测试工具查找 ArduPilot 代码库问题时，这可能有助于发现真正的问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:58
#: bd2cd7a432764ba895fdeb4b6d8e4aab
msgid ""
"One exception to the trusted-ground-control-station model is if "
":ref:`MAVLink2 Signing <common-MAVLink2-signing>` is enabled.  If the serial"
" port is configured for MAVLink2 signing, unsigned packets will be ignored "
"and should not cause the vehicle to misbehave with the possible exception of"
" DOS attacks.  If you believe you have found a situation where an unsigned "
"packet on a MAVLink2 signed connection causes unexpected behaviour please "
"see the \"Reporting Security Issues\" section below."
msgstr ""
"受信任地面控制站模型的一个例外是启用了 :ref:`MAVLink2 签名 <common-MAVLink2-signing>` 的情况。如果串口配置为"
" MAVLink2 签名，未签名的数据包将被忽略，除可能的 DOS 攻击外，不应导致飞行器行为异常。如果您认为发现了在启用 MAVLink2 "
"签名的连接上未签名数据包导致意外行为的情况，请参阅下文“报告安全问题”部分。"

