#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:69
#: 148a55deb67f4b51a40911c1551fa12b
msgid "Feature Reduction"
msgstr "功能精简"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:71
#: 8561dce9ffec49fbbad4cba54ac9c5b7
msgid ""
"The `custom build server <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-custom-"
"firmware.html>`__ (`direct link <https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__) may be "
"used to create a firmware with only the minimum set of features and drivers "
"required for the vehicle.  This reduces the amount of code running on the "
"autopilot and thus the potential attack surface."
msgstr ""
"`自定义构建服务器 <https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-custom-firmware.html>`__"
" （`直达链接 "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__）可用于创建仅包含飞行器所需最少功能和驱动的固件。这减少了飞控上运行的代码量，从而缩小了潜在攻击面。"

