#: a7c95038902a493eb9243ceadb7dfd4f
msgid "*\"Open source software is lower quality than closed source software\"*"
msgstr "*“开源软件的质量比闭源软件低”*"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:123
#: 91b643a7d78044a6935360a3b1471589
msgid ""
"Completely false.  Code quality is determined by the developers, the review "
"process, the amount of testing and release procedures, not by whether it is "
"open or closed source."
msgstr "完全错误。代码质量取决于开发者、评审流程、测试量和发布程序，而不是取决于开源还是闭源。"

#: ../../source/docs/security-landing-page.rst:125
#: 63dd3928c1ac449eb69578bd233195d4
msgid ""
"The core ArduPilot development team is very focused on code quality and has "
"a rigorous code review process.  Each change (aka Pull Request) must pass "
"hundreds of automated checks and be reviewed by one or more dev team members"
" before being \"merged\" into the main code base.  After merging the "
"combined code is continuously subject to automated testing and real flight "
"testing by the core dev team and community members before even reaching the "
"beta testing stage.  Beta testing of major releases normally takes 3 months "
"during which time partner companies and community members test the software "
"on a wide range of vehicles.  Incident reports are logged, investigated and "
"fixes applied as required.  Only after beta testing is complete is the "
"software released as the stable/official version.  Post release, the core "
"dev team carefully monitors the forums for incidents and prioritises bug "
"fixes over enhancements, dutifully reporting critical issues in a timely "
"manner to the community."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 核心开发团队非常注重代码质量，并拥有严格的代码评审流程。每项更改（即 Pull "
"Request）必须通过数百项自动化检查，并经过一名或多名开发团队成员评审后才能“合并”进主代码库。合并后，合并的代码会持续接受自动化测试，并由核心开发团队和社区成员进行真实飞行测试，然后才进入"
" beta 测试阶段。主要版本的 beta 测试通常持续 3 "
"个月，在此期间合作伙伴公司和社区成员会在各种飞行器上测试该软件。事故报告会被记录、调查，并根据需要应用修复。只有在 beta "
"测试完成后，软件才会作为稳定/正式版本发布。发布后，核心开发团队会密切关注论坛上的事故，并将错误修复置于功能增强之前，及时尽责地向社区通报关键问题。"
